{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】女子網球年終賽將會由安祖莉娃和絲維度蓮娜爭冠軍。</p>\n<p>湖水綠衫安祖莉娃四強鬥柏高娜，兩盤都是先被破發下贏回對方兩個發球局，贏6比3和6比4，取得決賽資格。對手是2018年冠軍、紅衫的絲維度蓮娜，她在另一場四強以兩盤6比2和6比1，擊敗溫網冠軍露絲高娃，相隔7年再打入決賽。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T05:56:07.309077+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T05:31:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T05:50:00.829253+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T05:50:00.829253+00:00","content_hash":"731d3eeab17951996b1bc8fc6bf70bf61d80fd97b315022d295267a1e109e2bb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}